---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open Template Maker]
    B --> C[Describe template requirements]
    C --> D[Define branding and required fields]
    D --> E[Generate template package]
    E --> F[Review manifest and template files]
    F --> G[Preview sample document]
    G --> H[Run template validation]
    H --> I{Validation successful?}

    I -- No --> J[Display validation errors]
    J --> K[Modify template]
    K --> H

    I -- Yes --> L[Prepare submission]
    L --> M([End])